  "prefLabel": "Puc 2202.07 Confidential customer information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2202.07 “Confidential customer information” means information that is collected as part of providing electric services to a customer that can identify, singly or in combination, that specific customer, and includes the customer name, address, and account number and the quantity, characteristics, or time of consumption by the customer, and also includes specific customer payment, financial, banking, and credit information.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
